urface":"田仁","kind":"person","person_id":"gyt_axg_s7t_A","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-104-tianshu","book_id":"b-shiji-104","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-104-tianshu"},{"id":"c-shiji-104-tianshu:p016","text":"是時任安為北軍使者護軍，太子立車北軍南門外，召任安，與節令發兵。安拜受節，入，閉門不出。武帝聞之，以為任安為詳邪，不傅事，何也？任安笞辱北軍錢官小吏，小吏上書言之，以為受太子節，言「幸與我其鮮好者」。書上聞，武帝曰：「是老吏也，見兵事起，欲坐觀成敗，見勝者欲合從之，有兩心。安有當死之罪甚眾，吾常活之，今懷詐，有不忠之心。」下安吏，誅死。夫月滿則虧，物盛則衰，天地之常也。知進而不知退，久乘富貴，禍積為祟。故范蠡之去越，辭不受官位，名傳後世，萬歲不忘，豈可及哉！後進者慎戒之。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"witness_appended_chu_note","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-104-tianshu:m016-0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"任安","kind":"person","person_id":"y9g_gi6_sn7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-104-tianshu:m016-0012","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"太子","kind":"person","person_id":"64t_pmo_3d4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-104-tianshu:m016-0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"任安","kind":"person","person_id":"y9g_gi6_sn7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-104-tianshu:m016-0032","start":32,"end":33,"surface":"安","kind":"person","person_id":"y9g_gi6_sn7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-104-tianshu:m016-0044","start":44,"end":46,"surface":"武帝","kind":"person","person_id":"egj_ken_pn3","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-104-tianshu:m016-0051","start":51,"end":53,"surface":"任安","kind":"person","person_id":"y9g_gi6_sn7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-104-tianshu:m016-0064","start":64,"end":66,"surface":"任安","kind":"person","person_id":"y9g_gi6_sn7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-104-tianshu:m016-0085","start":85,"end":87,"surface":"太子","kind":"person","person_id":"64t_pmo_3d4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-104-tianshu:m016-0104","start":104,"end":106,"surface":"武帝","kind":"person","person_id":"egj_ken_pn3","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-104-tianshu:m016-0137","start":137,"end":138,"s